games.desc:
A continuation from our previous game 'Busan'.

Basic Controls :
Double tap 'W' to RUN 
'Q' to DASH
'R' to EVADE
Hold F with your combat style tool to BLOCK
LMB for attacking
RMB for GUARD BREAK

